Ctrl+W
Ctrl+W w  Cycle the layouts: split, chat, list and focus
Ctrl+W h  Show or hide the list
Ctrl+W l  Show or hide the chat; under 80 columns, open the chat alone
Ctrl+W o  Put the chat over the video or beside it
Ctrl+W x  Swap the sides of the list and the chat
Ctrl+W +  Increase overlay chat height
Ctrl+W -  Decrease overlay chat height
Ctrl+W <  Move the chat divider to the left
Ctrl+W >  Move the chat divider to the right
Esc cancel
Enter open · f ★ · / filter · Ctrl+F search · ? help
